  "cn": "太好了！递给我锤子。",
  "score": 0.63
 },
 {
  "i": 145,
  "en": "You're sure Alexandra's going to be surprised?",
  "cn": "你确定亚历山德拉会惊喜？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 146,
  "en": "Absolutely. She has no idea that the party isn't her honor.",
  "cn": "她完全不知道派对是为她办的。",
  "score": 0.79
 },
 {
  "i": 147,
  "en": "Millie, did you bring the tapes for dancing?",
  "cn": "米莉，你带跳舞的磁带了吗？",
  "score": 0.95
 },
 {
  "i": 148,
  "en": "They're in my bag.",
  "cn": "在我包里。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 149,
  "en": "What did you bring?",
  "cn": "你带了什么？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 150,
  "en": "The mackerel.",
  "cn": "这mackerel.",
  "score": 0.3
 },
 {
  "i": 151,
  "en": "Perfect. Alexandra will love it.",
  "cn": "完美！亚历山德拉会喜欢的！",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 152,
  "en": "I can't wait to see her face when she walks in here tonight.",
  "cn": "我等不及看她今晚走进来时的表情。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 153,
  "en": "But what about the cake?",
  "cn": "蛋糕呢？",
  "score": 0.86
 },
 {
  "i": 154,
  "en": "My mom's decorating it right now.",
  "cn": "我妈妈正在装饰。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 155,
  "en": "Robbie, there's a phone call for you. It's Alexandra. She sounds upset.",
  "cn": "罗比，有你电话。",
  "score": 0.65
 },
 {
  "i": 156,
  "en": "Okay, thanks, Mom. I'll take it in there.",
  "cn": "我在那里接。",
  "score": 0.68
 },
 {
  "i": 157,
  "en": "Hi, Alexandra. Oh, no.",
  "cn": "嗨，亚历山德拉。",
  "score": 0.68
 },
 {
  "i": 158,
  "en": "Let's wait till Robbie gets back from the airport.",
  "cn": "不，我们等罗比从机场回来。",
  "score": 0.94
 },
 {
  "i": 159,
  "en": "Did she say why she had to leave today?",
  "cn": "她说为什么她得今天走吗？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 160,
  "en": "She told Robbie that her flight tomorrow was canceled,",
  "cn": "她告诉罗比她明天的航班取消了，",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 161,
  "en": "so she had to take an earlier flight today.",
  "cn": "所以她得搭今天更早的航班。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 162,
  "en": "This is terrible.",
  "cn": "太糟糕了。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 163,
  "en": "Well, that must be him.",
  "cn": "嗯，那一定是他。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 164,
  "en": "Why is he blowing this horn like that?",
  "cn": "他为什么那样按喇叭？",
  "score": 0.9
 },
 {
  "i": 165,
  "en": "I don't know. Maybe he's angry.",
  "cn": "也许他生气了。",
  "score": 0.63
 },
 {
  "i": 166,
  "en": "Do you think we should take down the decorations?",
  "cn": "你觉得我们应该撤下装饰吗？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 167,
  "en": "We'll just make him sad.",
  "cn": "那只会让他难过。",
  "score": 0.82
 },
 {
  "i": 168,
  "en": "Too late now. We should have done it sooner.",
  "cn": "我们该早点撤的。",
  "score": 0.76
 },
 {
  "i": 169,
  "en": "Oh, here he comes.",
  "cn": "哦，他来了。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 170,
  "en": "Hi. How'd it go?",
  "cn": "怎么样？",
  "score": 0.83
 },
 {
  "i": 171,
  "en": "Okay, I guess.",
  "cn": "还行吧，我猜。",
  "score": 0.75
 },
 {
  "i": 172,
  "en": "Especially when Alexandra gave me a surprise.",
  "cn": "尤其是亚历山德拉给了我一个惊喜……",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 173,
  "en": "Yeah, what was it?",
  "cn": "是吗？什么惊喜？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 174,
  "en": "This.",
  "cn": "这个！",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 175,
  "en": "Hi. What happened?",
  "cn": "嗨！发生什么了？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 176,
  "en": "I called my parents from the airport.",
  "cn": "我从机场给我父母打了电话。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 177,
  "en": "When I told them my friends were giving me a party,",
  "cn": "朋友们给我办派对，",
  "score": 0.73
 },
 {
  "i": 178,
  "en": "they insisted that I stay.",
  "cn": "他们坚持要我留下。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 179,
  "en": "So now I'm taking a flight on Monday instead.",
  "cn": "所以现在我改搭星期一的航班。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 180,
  "en": "That's great. Terrific.",
  "cn": "太好了！棒极了！",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 181,
  "en": "But how did you know the party was for you?",
  "cn": "但你怎么知道派对是为我办的？",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 182,
  "en": "Well, Robbie told me when he gave me this.",
  "cn": "嗯，罗比送我这个时告诉我的。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 183,
  "en": "Oh, so pretty.",
  "cn": "哦，太漂亮了！",
  "score": 0.8
 },
 {
  "i": 184,
  "en": "Lovely, Robbie.",
  "cn": "很可爱，罗比。",
  "score": 0.77
 },
 {
  "i": 185,
  "en": "All right. Now we can really start the party.",
  "cn": "现在我们可以真正开始派对了！",
  "score": 0.83
 },
 {
  "i": 186,
  "en": "No, would you mind? I'd like to say something first.",
  "cn": "我想先说几句。",
  "score": 0.7
 },
 {
  "i": 187,
  "en": "You're here.",
  "cn": "嗯，既然你在这儿，",
  "score": 0.53
 },
 {
  "i": 188,
  "en": "I would just like to thank all of you, my friends,",
  "cn": "我只是想感谢你们所有人，",
  "score": 0.85
 },
 {
  "i": 189,
  "en": "who have made my stay in the United States so wonderful,",
  "cn": "让我的美国之行如此美好。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 190,
  "en": "and to Robbie and the Stewart family",
  "cn": "还有罗比和斯图尔特一家，",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 191,
  "en": "for opening their home to me.",
  "cn": "对我敞开家门。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 192,
  "en": "We should thank you. You're a real friend.",
  "cn": "你是个真正的朋友！",
  "score": 0.6
 },
 {
  "i": 193,
  "en": "And I also have a little surprise for you, Robbie.",
  "cn": "我也给你一个小惊喜，罗比。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 194,
  "en": "A little going away present.",
  "cn": "一个小临别礼物。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 195,
  "en": "Thank you.",
  "cn": "谢谢你.",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 196,
  "en": "Open it, please. I think you might be amused.",
  "cn": "我认为",
  "score": 0.74
 },
 {
  "i": 197,
  "en": "Okay. I can't believe it.",
  "cn": "好。我真不敢相信！",
  "score": 0.84
 },
 {
  "i": 198,
  "en": "I guess we were thinking of the same thought.",
  "cn": "我想我们是想到了一起。",
  "score": 0.93
 },
 {
  "i": 199,
  "en": "You had it engraved.",
  "cn": "你刻了字！",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 200,
  "en": "Read it, Robbie.",
  "cn": "念出来，罗比。",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 201,
  "en": "In friendship always, Alexandra.",
  "cn": "「友谊长存。亚历山德拉。」",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 202,
  "en": "I knew we thought alike, but this is too much.",
  "cn": "我就知道我们想法一样，",
  "score": 0.61
 },
 {
  "i": 203,
  "en": "Thank you.",
  "cn": "谢谢你.",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 204,
  "en": "Right. Let's have some evening.",
  "cn": "来点音乐吧！",
  "score": 0.61
 },
 {
  "i": 205,
  "en": "All right.",
  "cn": "好的!",
  "score": 1.0
 },
 {
  "i": 206,
  "en": "Miss Hoppe.",
  "cn": "想念Hoppe.",
  "score": 0.3
 },
 {
  "i": 207,
  "en": "Mrs. Stewart.",
  "cn": "斯图尔特先生……",
  "score": 0.55
 },
 {
  "i": 208,
  "en": "May I understand?",
  "cn": "May我理解",
  "score": 0.3
 },
 {
  "i": 209,
  "en": "My pleasure, Doc.",
  "cn": "我的荣幸，医生。",
  "score": 0.75
 }
